sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Analyst
    participant Agent as Investigation Agent
    participant MCP as MCP Tools
    participant TI as Threat Intel & DNS

    Analyst->>Agent: Request IP attribution (e.g. 192.0.2.1)
    Agent->>MCP: lookup_ip (ASN / GeoIP)
    MCP->>TI: Query IPinfo Lite DB
    TI-->>MCP: ASN & Organization details
    MCP-->>Agent: Return IP metadata

    Agent->>MCP: check_ip (Abuse & Tor check)
    MCP->>TI: Query AbuseIPDB / Tor node list
    TI-->>MCP: Reputation & Exit status
    MCP-->>Agent: Return Reputation score

    Agent->>Agent: Correlate findings & Evaluate confidence
    Agent-->>Analyst: Return Attribution Report
